<SPT><TTL>Test Section</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>[Place a test section of at least<MET> 2.5 by 30 m</MET><ENG> 8 by 100 feet</ENG>, utilizing the equipment and procedures proposed 
for use, to demonstrate that bituminous stabilized mixture conforming to this specification can be produced.  
Acceptance of the test section is based on compliance with the tolerances listed in Table 1.] [A test section 
is not required.]</TXT><BRK/></SPT>
<BRK/></SPT>
</PRT><PRT><TTL>PART 2   PRODUCTS</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL>MATERIALS</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL>Bituminous Material</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
NOTE:  Select asphalt emulsion type for the bituminous-stablized subgrade based on the soil classification of 
the subgrade soils evaluated during the site geotechnical investigation.<BRK/>
<TAB>
<WBK>
